        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Misadventures of Merlin Jones, In Search of the Castaways, The Monkey's Uncle, Moving Day\n- People: Tommy Kirk, Annette Funicello, Hayley Mills, Maurice Chevalier, Robert Stevenson, Lowell S. Hawley, Jules Verne, Ben Sharpsteen, Walt Disney, Clarence Nash, Pinto Colvig, Billy Bletcher\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions, Walt Disney\n- Concepts: sequel, screenplay, adventure novel\n\nFacts:\n- Jules Verne wrote the 1868 adventure novel \"Captain Grant's Children.\"\n- Moving Day is a 1936 film directed by Ben Sharpsteen.\n- Moving Day includes the voices of Walt Disney as Mickey, Clarence Nash as Donald, Pinto Colvig as Goofy, and Billy Bletcher as Pete the Sheriff.\n- In Search of the Castaways is a 1962 Walt Disney Productions feature film starring Hayley Mills and Maurice Chevalier.\n- In Search of the Castaways tells a story about a worldwide search for a shipwrecked sea captain.\n- In Search of the Castaways was directed by Robert Stevenson from a screenplay by Lowell S. Hawley based on Jules Verne's 1868 novel.\n- The Misadventures of Merlin Jones is a 1964 Walt Disney production starring Tommy Kirk and Annette Funicello.\n- The Monkey's Uncle is a sequel to the 1964 film The Misadventures of Merlin Jones.",
